\x1B[36m  details\x1B[0m
    Show retained lifecycle operation history: the latest run, a compact list, or one run by
      identity

\x1B[1;34mMore commands:\x1B[0m
\x1B[1;34m  Inventory:\x1B[0m
\x1B[36m  list\x1B[0m
    List read-only inventory for Projects, Profiles, or Hosts
\x1B[1;34m  Teardown:\x1B[0m
\x1B[36m  uninstall\x1B[0m
    Remove selected Project installations and forget their recorded selection; a lone --profile
      reaches that Profile's installations fleet-wide; --host removes only those Hosts within the
      scope
\x1B[1;34m  Machine details:\x1B[0m
\x1B[36m  info\x1B[0m
    Show the engine version and selected application locations

\x1B[2mFor deeper Workspace authoring guidance (Context Modules, Skills, Profiles, and bindings), run\x1B[0m
\x1B[2m  apkit guide --full.\x1B[0m
--- stderr ---
"
`;

