exports[`rendering matrix for a representative subset blocked status matrix: status-blocked-interactive-narrow-nocolor 1`] = `
"--- stdout ---
Cannot update
- needs attention (1):
  ~/projects/blocked
    Blocker: .codex/hooks.json is
      tracked by Git, so Agent Profile
      Kit cannot write to it.
      Requirement: Agent Profile Kit
        must exclusively manage its
        generated files; Git-tracked
        paths cannot be replaced.
      Remedy: Choose one. To let Agent
        Profile Kit manage these files,
        run
        git --literal-pathspecs -C '/private/tmp/apkit-golden-xxxx/projects/blocked' rm -r --cached -- '.codex/hooks.json'
        — it stages their removal from
        the Git index while the files
        stay on disk; commit afterwards
        to keep the change — then run
        apkit update '/private/tmp/apkit-golden-xxxx/projects/blocked'.
        To keep Git ownership instead,
        leave the files in place.
      Affected paths (1):
        - .codex/hooks.json

Projects: 1 · Blockers: 1

Next:
- Resolve the reported blocker, then run
  apkit status '~/projects/blocked'
  again.
--- stderr ---
"
`;

